{"seq":2,"slug":"sodium-ion-batteries","title":"钠离子电池","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/next-gen-batteries/sodium-ion-batteries","wordCount":2110,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"钠离子电池\">钠离子电池</h1><p>锂资源的地缘集中（澳大利亚、智利、阿根廷控制全球 80%+ 产量）和价格剧烈波动（2022 年碳酸锂价格从 5 万涨至 60 万元/吨再跌回 8 万元/吨），迫使产业界寻找替代方案。钠离子电池凭借资源无约束、成本潜力低、低温性能优异三大优势，在 2026 年正式进入大规模商业化元年。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>钠离子电池的核心逻辑是<strong>用资源禀赋换能量密度</strong>——在锂资源受限和价格波动的背景下，用略低的性能换取更低的成本和更稳的供应链。关键概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>资源约束下的成本潜力</strong>：钠丰度为锂的 400 余倍且全球分布均匀，碳酸钠价格仅为碳酸锂的几十分之一，这是钠电成本优势的物理根源。</li>\n<li><strong>离子半径决定性能天花板</strong>：钠离子半径（1.02 Å）大于锂（0.76 Å），更难嵌入致密结构，导致能量密度天然低于锂电；但宽层间结构下钠迁移更快，带来优异的低温性能。</li>\n<li><strong>三条正极路线</strong>：层状氧化物（高容量）、普鲁士蓝类似物（极低成本）、聚阴离子（超长寿命），路线选择对应不同应用定位。</li>\n<li><strong>硬碳是标配负极</strong>：钠无法嵌入石墨，硬碳的无序结构和纳米孔隙提供了储钠空间，其&quot;三区域&quot;机制与石墨储锂机制不同。</li>\n<li><strong>定位而非取代</strong>：钠电的战场是两轮车、A00 级 BEV、储能、低温场景——与锂电形成互补而非替代。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个常见误解：把钠电当作&quot;低配锂电池&quot;。在成本敏感、寿命要求高、低温严苛的场景，钠电反而是更优解，评价标准应回到应用场景本身。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要钠电\">为什么需要钠电</h2><p>钠是地壳中第六丰富的元素（丰度 2.36%，是锂的 400 余倍），全球分布均匀，海水中含量更是几乎无穷。中国可以 100% 自给钠资源，完全摆脱对南美锂三角和澳洲锂矿的依赖。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>锂（Li）</th>\n<th>钠（Na）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>地壳丰度</td>\n<td>0.006%</td>\n<td>2.36%（400倍）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>海水浓度</td>\n<td>0.18 ppm</td>\n<td>10,800 ppm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要产地</td>\n<td>澳/智/阿根廷</td>\n<td>全球均匀分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原子量</td>\n<td>6.94</td>\n<td>23.0（3.3倍）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>离子半径</td>\n<td>0.76 Å</td>\n<td>1.02 Å（大 34%）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准电位</td>\n<td>-3.04V vs SHE</td>\n<td>-2.71V vs SHE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>碳酸盐价格（2025）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span></span></span></span>8 万元/吨</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span></span></span></span>3000 元/吨</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>钠离子半径较大（1.02 vs 0.76 Å）意味着它更难嵌入致密的层状结构——这是钠电能量密度天然低于锂电的物理根源。但这个&quot;缺点&quot;在某些方面反而是优势：钠不会在石墨中嵌入（避免了析钠问题），且钠离子在某些宽层间结构中迁移更快（低温性能优异）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"正极材料路线\">正极材料路线</h2><p>钠电正极有三条主要技术路线：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[钠电正极路线] --&gt; B[层状氧化物]&#10;    A --&gt; C[普鲁士蓝类似物 PBA]&#10;    A --&gt; D[聚阴离子化合物]&#10;    B --&gt; E[高容量 120-160 mAh/g]&#10;    B --&gt; F[空气敏感 需保护]&#10;    C --&gt; G[低成本 开放框架]&#10;    C --&gt; H[结晶水控制困难]&#10;    D --&gt; I[高稳定性 长寿命]&#10;    D --&gt; J[容量偏低 100-120 mAh/g]\">graph TD\n    A[钠电正极路线] --&gt; B[层状氧化物]\n    A --&gt; C[普鲁士蓝类似物 PBA]\n    A --&gt; D[聚阴离子化合物]\n    B --&gt; E[高容量 120-160 mAh/g]\n    B --&gt; F[空气敏感 需保护]\n    C --&gt; G[低成本 开放框架]\n    C --&gt; H[结晶水控制困难]\n    D --&gt; I[高稳定性 长寿命]\n    D --&gt; J[容量偏低 100-120 mAh/g]</pre><p><strong>层状氧化物</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Na</mtext><mi>x</mi></msub><msub><mtext>MO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Na}_x\\text{MO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Na</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，M = Fe、Mn、Ni、Cu 等）：</p>\n<p>结构类似于锂电的 NCM，容量最高（120-160 mAh/g），但存在多种相变（P2/O3 型交替）和空气稳定性问题。宁德时代第二代钠电采用自研&quot;超电子网&quot;正极材料属于此类。</p>\n<p><strong>普鲁士蓝类似物（PBA）</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Na</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>M[Fe(CN)</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Na}_2\\text{M[Fe(CN)}_6]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Na</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">M[Fe(CN)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>）：</p>\n<p>开放框架结构使钠离子可以快速嵌脱，倍率性能优异。原材料（铁、锰、碳、氮）极其廉价。核心挑战是控制结晶水含量——含水 PBA 循环衰减快。中科海钠的产品基于此路线。</p>\n<p><strong>聚阴离子化合物</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Na</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mtext>V</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>PO</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Na}_3\\text{V}_2(\\text{PO}_4)_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Na</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">V</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>NaFePO</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{NaFePO}_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NaFePO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 等）：</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mtext>PO</mtext><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PO}_4^{3-}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1343em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mtext>SO</mtext><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SO}_4^{2-}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1343em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 多面体提供强骨架支撑，结构极其稳定，循环寿命可达 10000+。但含钒化合物成本高，正在被无钒方案（铁基、锰基）替代。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>正极路线</th>\n<th>代表材料</th>\n<th>容量 (mAh/g)</th>\n<th>电压平台</th>\n<th>核心优势</th>\n<th>主要挑战</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>层状氧化物</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Na</mtext><mn>0.67</mn></msub><msub><mtext>Mn</mtext><mn>0.67</mn></msub><msub><mtext>Ni</mtext><mn>0.33</mn></msub><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Na}_{0.67}\\text{Mn}_{0.67}\\text{Ni}_{0.33}\\text{O}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Na</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.67</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mn</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.67</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ni</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.33</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>140-160</td>\n<td>3.0-3.8V</td>\n<td>高容量</td>\n<td>相变、空气敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PBA</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Na</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>MnFe(CN)</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Na}_2\\text{MnFe(CN)}_6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Na</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MnFe(CN)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>110-140</td>\n<td>3.0-3.5V</td>\n<td>极低成本</td>\n<td>结晶水、低压实</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚阴离子</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Na</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mtext>V</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>PO</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Na}_3\\text{V}_2(\\text{PO}_4)_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Na</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">V</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>100-120</td>\n<td>3.4V</td>\n<td>超长寿命</td>\n<td>容量低、含钒</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"硬碳负极与储钠机制\">硬碳负极与储钠机制</h2><p>钠无法嵌入石墨（热力学不稳定），因此硬碳成为钠电的标配负极。硬碳的储钠容量（250-350 mAh/g）虽低于石墨储锂（372 mAh/g），但已足够支撑 160-220 Wh/kg 的电芯能量密度。</p>\n<p>储钠机制的&quot;三区域模型&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>区域</th>\n<th>电压范围 vs Na</th>\n<th>储存方式</th>\n<th>容量贡献</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>斜坡区（高压）</td>\n<td>1.0-0.1V</td>\n<td>缺陷位吸附 + 层间嵌入</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span></span></span></span>40-50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台区（低压）</td>\n<td>&lt;0.1V</td>\n<td>纳米孔填充（准金属态）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span></span></span></span>50-60%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>生物质衍生硬碳（椰壳、稻壳、棉花）因含有丰富的天然孔隙结构，经 1200-1500°C 碳化后可获得高闭孔比例的优质硬碳。2025 年国内硬碳均价约 4-6 万元/吨，预计 2027 年随着规模效应降至 3 万元/吨以下。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与锂电的全面对比\">与锂电的全面对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性能指标</th>\n<th>钠电（2026 第二代）</th>\n<th>LFP 锂电</th>\n<th>NCM 锂电</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>能量密度</td>\n<td>160-220 Wh/kg</td>\n<td>180-210 Wh/kg</td>\n<td>250-300 Wh/kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环寿命</td>\n<td>5000-15000 次</td>\n<td>4000-8000 次</td>\n<td>1000-2000 次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低温性能（-20°C）</td>\n<td>容量保持 90%+</td>\n<td>容量保持 60-70%</td>\n<td>容量保持 70-80%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快充能力</td>\n<td>3-5C（12C 实验室）</td>\n<td>2-4C</td>\n<td>2-3C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全性</td>\n<td>可放电至 0V 运输</td>\n<td>需维持 SOC 运输</td>\n<td>需维持 SOC 运输</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电芯成本（2026）</td>\n<td>0.25-0.35 元/Wh</td>\n<td>0.35-0.45 元/Wh</td>\n<td>0.50-0.70 元/Wh</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>宁德时代第二代钠电核心参数（2026 款）：能量密度 200-220 Wh/kg，快充 10 分钟 10→80%，循环 5000+ 次，成本比 LFP 低 30-40%。这一代产品已首次达到&quot;可用&quot;门槛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"商业化进展与产业格局\">商业化进展与产业格局</h2><p>2026 年 4 月，宁德时代与海博思创（HyperStrong）签署 60GWh 钠电储能战略协议——这是全球最大的钠离子电池订单，相当于宁德时代 2025 年全部储能出货量的一半。宁德时代表示已&quot;全面攻克钠离子电池量产链的挑战&quot;。</p>\n<p>主要商业化事件时间线：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2023.12：首款钠电乘用车（江淮钇为 3）小批量交付</li>\n<li>2025.4：宁德时代发布 Naxtra 钠电品牌，175 Wh/kg</li>\n<li>2025.12：宁德时代宣布 2026 为&quot;钠电大规模商业化元年&quot;</li>\n<li>2026.2：长安 Nevo A06 成为首款正式上市的钠电 BEV</li>\n<li>2026.4：宁德时代签署 60GWh 钠电储能大单</li>\n</ul>\n<p>产能方面，宁德时代已在江苏溧阳、福建宁德、四川宜宾建成超 30GWh 钠电专用产线，2026 年总产能目标 50GWh。</p>\n<h2 id=\"适用场景定位\">适用场景定位</h2><p>钠电并非要&quot;取代&quot;锂电，而是在特定场景中发挥比较优势：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>为什么适合钠电</th>\n<th>目标产品</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>两轮电动车</td>\n<td>安全（不爆炸）+ 成本极低</td>\n<td>与雅迪/爱玛合作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>A00/A0 级 BEV</td>\n<td>售价 4-6 万元档需极致成本</td>\n<td>五菱/奇瑞/长安</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>储能电站</td>\n<td>长寿命 15000 圈 + 成本低</td>\n<td>60GWh 大单已落地</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>换电网络</td>\n<td>快充+低成本+安全</td>\n<td>乐道 L60 钠电版</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低温场景</td>\n<td>-40°C 容量保持 &gt;90%</td>\n<td>东北/北欧/冷链物流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[钠电定位] --&gt; B[高端看锂]&#10;    A --&gt; C[普及靠钠]&#10;    B --&gt; D[NCM/NCA 600km+]&#10;    C --&gt; E[两轮/A00/储能]&#10;    C --&gt; F[成本 &lt; 0.3元/Wh]&#10;    C --&gt; G[寿命 &gt; 10000圈]\">graph LR\n    A[钠电定位] --&gt; B[高端看锂]\n    A --&gt; C[普及靠钠]\n    B --&gt; D[NCM/NCA 600km+]\n    C --&gt; E[两轮/A00/储能]\n    C --&gt; F[成本 &lt; 0.3元/Wh]\n    C --&gt; G[寿命 &gt; 10000圈]</pre><p>IEA 预测钠离子电池全球市场规模将在 2026 年达到 10.8 亿美元，复合增长率 15.8%。但当前产量仍不足锂电的 1%——规模化提速取决于上游硬碳供应链的完善和下游应用场景的开拓。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>钠电的战略价值在于资源无约束：钠丰度为锂的 400 余倍且分布均匀，可摆脱对南美锂三角和澳洲锂矿的依赖。</li>\n<li>离子半径大导致能量密度天然低于锂电（160-220 Wh/kg），但带来优异低温性能（-20°C 保持 90%+）和不析钠的安全性。</li>\n<li>正极三条路线（层状氧化物/PBA/聚阴离子）分别对应容量、成本、寿命的不同侧重。</li>\n<li>硬碳是钠电标配负极，储钠遵循&quot;斜坡区吸附嵌入 + 平台区孔填充&quot;机制。</li>\n<li>商业化已进入规模元年（宁德时代 60GWh 储能大单、首款钠电 BEV 上市），定位在两轮车、A00 级车、储能和低温场景。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"钠离子电池","id":"钠离子电池"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要钠电","id":"为什么需要钠电"},{"level":2,"text":"正极材料路线","id":"正极材料路线"},{"level":2,"text":"硬碳负极与储钠机制","id":"硬碳负极与储钠机制"},{"level":2,"text":"与锂电的全面对比","id":"与锂电的全面对比"},{"level":2,"text":"商业化进展与产业格局","id":"商业化进展与产业格局"},{"level":2,"text":"适用场景定位","id":"适用场景定位"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"固态电池","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/next-gen-batteries/solid-state-batteries"},"next":{"title":"锂硫与锂空气电池","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/next-gen-batteries/lithium-sulfur-air"}}